graph LR
  H[Human<br/>approves chunks, reads diffs,<br/>decides what becomes a commit]
  C[Controller<br/>Opus 5.5, Fable 5.1 on long runs<br/>holds plan + chunk summaries]
  IM[Implementer, mechanical<br/>Haiku 4.5]
  IO[Implementer, one-way doors<br/>Opus 5.5<br/>schema, auth, money, contracts]
  RV[Task reviewer<br/>Sonnet 5, Opus 5.5 if high risk<br/>uses review-routing]
  RR[Scoped re-review<br/>Haiku 4.5]
  FW[Whole-tree review<br/>Opus 5.5]
  XM[Cross-model review<br/>Codex, different model family]
  H -- plan + next --> C
  C -- task by risk class --> IM
  C -- task by risk class --> IO
  IM & IO -- uncommitted diff --> RV
  RV -- findings --> IM
  RV -- clean --> RR
  RR -- clean, high risk --> XM
  XM -- claims to adjudicate --> C
  C -- after last chunk --> FW
  FW --> XM
  C -- chunk report --> H
